1
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:14,453
Medoro Demo Pharmacy ki do branches hain: Main
Road, do counters ke saath,

2
00:00:14,493 --> 00:00:17,198
aur Kanke Road, ek counter ke saath.

3
00:00:17,238 --> 00:00:21,697
Branches 'Users & branches' screen se sambhaali
jaati hain.

4
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:28,497
Yahan nayi branch jod sakte hain aur har branch
ke counters ki sankhya tay kar sakte hain.

5
00:00:28,537 --> 00:00:33,418
Upar branch ka naam badalkar aap kisi bhi branch
ka data dekh sakte hain.

6
00:00:34,159 --> 00:00:40,804
Staff ko branch ke hisaab se joda jaata hai;
udaaharan ke liye humne Kanke Road ke liye
pharmacist

7
00:00:40,844 --> 00:00:42,918
aur cashier ko invite kiya tha.

8
00:00:42,958 --> 00:00:45,647
Permissions hum agle part mein dekhenge.

9
00:00:46,406 --> 00:00:53,234
Stock transfer humne Inventory part mein dekha
tha: batch se maatra chunkar doosri branch ko
Send.

10
00:00:53,274 --> 00:00:58,000
Transfers ka record isi 'Branches & transfers'
hisse mein rehta hai.

11
00:00:58,773 --> 00:01:04,102
Sabhi branches ki ek saath tasveer Owner view
mein hai: har branch ki aaj

12
00:01:04,142 --> 00:01:09,911
aur kal ki bikri, drawers mein cash, low stock
aur expiry, sab branches jodkar.

13
00:01:09,951 --> 00:01:13,000
Yeh screen phone par bhi achhi chalti hai.

14
00:01:13,775 --> 00:01:18,789
Dhyan dein: Google Drive wale hosted setup mein
bills counters par rehte hain,

15
00:01:18,829 --> 00:01:22,807
isliye Owner view ke aankde Medoro server ki
copy se aate hain

16
00:01:22,847 --> 00:01:30,259
aur yahan shoonya dikh sakte hain; har counter
ki asli bikri uske Dashboard par Branch
performance mein dikhti hai.

17
00:01:36,321 --> 00:01:41,472
Users screen par har user ka role, branch,
two-step verification ki sthiti

18
00:01:41,512 --> 00:01:44,488
aur aakhri baar kab active tha, dikhta hai.

19
00:01:45,246 --> 00:01:49,138
Naya staff jodne ke liye 'Add employee'
dabaaiye.

20
00:01:49,178 --> 00:01:51,545
Naam, role aur branch chuniye.

21
00:01:51,585 --> 00:01:56,038
Counter staff, jaise cashier, pharmacy code,
employee ID

22
00:01:56,078 --> 00:02:02,216
aur PIN se login karte hain; owner aur manager
password aur authenticator se.

23
00:02:02,996 --> 00:02:08,660
'Roles & permissions' mein har role ke adhikaar
tay hote hain: Owner, Manager,

24
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:11,950
Pharmacist, Cashier, Accountant aur Delivery.

25
00:02:11,990 --> 00:02:17,361
Jaise cashier bill bana sakta hai, par purchase
ya report nahi dekh sakta,

26
00:02:17,401 --> 00:02:20,798
aur discount ki seema bhi role se tay hoti hai.

27
00:02:21,569 --> 00:02:26,911
Owner upar 'View as' se dekh sakta hai ki kisi
role ko screen kaisi dikhti hai.

28
00:02:26,951 --> 00:02:34,064
Jaise 'View as Cashier' chunne par sidebar mein
sirf wahi options bachte hain jo cashier ke kaam
ke hain.

29
00:02:34,816 --> 00:02:41,383
Audit trail mein har zaroori kaam ka record hai:
kisne, kab, kya badla, jaise login,

30
00:02:41,423 --> 00:02:45,001
sign-up, user invite ya settings mein badlaav.

31
00:02:45,041 --> 00:02:47,046
Ise mitaaya nahi ja sakta.

32
00:02:47,797 --> 00:02:53,161
Counter par har user ka kaam Activity screen par
bhi dikhta hai: kaunsa bill,

33
00:02:53,201 --> 00:02:55,267
kaunsa payment, kisne banaaya.

34
00:02:55,307 --> 00:03:00,742
Login security ke liye two-step verification,
paanch galat koshishon par lock,

35
00:03:00,782 --> 00:03:05,936
aur 'Profile & sessions' se baaki devices ko
sign out karne ka vikalp hai.
